id: dragon-dash
name: Dragon Dash
uaType: technical
prerequisite: Access to the Soar Maneuver
tpCost: 5
type: outOfSequence
actionCost: 0
kiCostPerTier: 2
# "If one of your Attacking Maneuvers or effects moves an Opponent out of your Melee Range" - offered on the Knockback
# Clash you won (chat.mjs dashStage): toward them or away, then the Movement Maneuver out of sequence.
dashes: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  When you move an Opponent out of your Melee Range: the Movement Maneuver out of sequence, straight toward them or away.
  Passive: Boosted Speed 1(T) higher.
text: >
  Dragon Dash: You zoom straight towards your destination, making up lost ground instantaneously.
  –Ability Type: Technical
  –Prerequisites: Access to the Soar Maneuver
  –TP Cost: 5
  –KP Cost: 2(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Out-of-Sequence
  –Action Cost: N/A
  –Minions: N/A
  –Passive Bonus: Increase your Boosted Speed by 1(T).
  –Effect: If one of your Attacking Maneuvers or effects moves an Opponent out of your Melee Range, you may use the
  Movement Maneuver to move in a straight line towards that Opponent or away from that Opponent as an Out-of-Sequence
  Maneuver.

---

# "Increase your Boosted Speed by 1(T)."
[passive]
speed.boosted += 1(T);
